To handle potential network delays, API rate limits, and connection failures gracefully, the application uses a retry logic with circuit breakers and fallback mechanisms to ensure high availability. The application also monitors and manages CPU, memory, and I/O usage to prevent resource exhaustion, and implements auto-scaling and monitoring tools to proactively address resource bottlenecks.

