The code also includes edge cases such as network failures during service integration, disk full errors during caching operations, and invalid PNG formats during parsing. It uses retry logic and fallback mechanisms to handle these issues gracefully, while still ensuring that the overall system performance and user experience are balanced between efficiency, usability, and maintainability.

