The code is designed to be modular and scalable, allowing developers to easily integrate it into larger applications where it will be part of a pipeline of data processing tasks. It also includes robust error handling and input validation to ensure robustness against malformed data and prevent resource exhaustion. The log file is rotated every hour to prevent excessive disk usage and logs older than one day are archived to a backup directory.']

