The system supports multiple configuration file formats and allows for easy addition of new integration points with third-party services. It also handles I/O errors gracefully by recovering from partial failures and continuing operation. The `evaluateCachingStrategies` method can be used to evaluate trade-offs between different caching strategies, such as LRU versus LFU, to maximize performance benefits.

